{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-19T02:50:14Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 计算机视觉 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a5be023a1e4dce95254b73c25b0400273a512383397b1039747e9196fc8004e5","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-arxiv-spool-low-latency-streaming-inference-for-hybrid-v-0-aa0e7ab947/","observation_id":"obs_aa0e7ab947744a9865e5d99b068d5185f84563f0a8c0f8885050e4157eb7050b","published_at":"2026-11-17T18:59:27Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"Spool 是一种免训练的低延迟流式推理框架，面向结合注意力层与线性循环层的混合视觉语言模型。它缓存各帧对应的状态变换并高效组合，使滑动窗口前移时无需重跑整个视频窗口即可移除过期帧。","title":"Spool: Low-Latency Streaming Inference for Hybrid Vision-Language Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_319b25ba2c0eeac770f0c2fe4598a32101d72d351f10a9e6b7dcb45a8aa5c881","internal_url":"/posts/20261118-arxiv-vira-toward-ultra-high-resolution-visual-agents-vi-0-51009fb859/","observation_id":"obs_51009fb859c1b51e38a4b6a73e59273e7d2a9ad7bec47f9e9cda8bfa869b4fff","published_at":"2026-11-16T18:59:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇工作提出 CrossRPO，通过对比不同版本的图像训练视觉智能体，使模型必须定位并读取局部证据，才能完成整组问答。作者据此构建了 ViRA-Train、ViRA-Bench 和 ViRA-Bench-Real，并训练出 ViRA-9B 与 ViRA-27B。","title":"ViRA: Toward Ultra-High-Resolution Visual Agents via Cross-Input Relative Policy Optimization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_307ac6c1faa6b84a995d5bc13a68467961b5d2e616cf0cdd06c4115f8565c788","internal_url":"/posts/20261117-arxiv-bal-bidirectional-autoregression-in-latent-space-f-2-bb23effe0a/","observation_id":"obs_bb23effe0afa49bfa17e1d85beaead937e1cca4fd8d9f0c44d363fc18ea14e1d","published_at":"2026-11-13T18:58:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"BAL 是一种面向三维人体姿态序列的自监督学习框架，在潜在空间中进行前向与后向的自回归预测，利用日常行为本身的时间顺序学习动作语义。它通过区分全局语义与局部运动信息，避免表示完全塌缩。","title":"BAL: Bidirectional Autoregression in Latent Space for Learning Human Movement Representations"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_21da80b8b9dd4d935178d0035b46a691ab8350207e2cdf02057ab449b8090f6c","internal_url":"/posts/20261113-arxiv-unbundling-multimodal-vision-encoding-0-b87d6d714a/","observation_id":"obs_b87d6d714a5b03b88d1f9c542a667ecfa74912540ca4590cf09e2eb86a04bcdf","published_at":"2026-11-12T18:59:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这项研究将多模态模型的视觉编码拆解为视觉先验、独立视觉容量，以及视觉模块在融合前的位置，并在统一数据、训练条件和计算预算下进行比较。结果表明，独立视觉容量更关键，而视觉模块不必单独放在多模态融合之前。","title":"Unbundling Multimodal Vision Encoding"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_166ae795a76d32596f9d4731aeb56fc949a9e0539f966d9ab4b191df94265fc9","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-arxiv-medical-image-segmentation-foundation-model-adapta-0-515e0e99a5/","observation_id":"obs_515e0e99a5a4b6e414052e3e4e9d662d4d5d202de637ef4ef2a5c4ae7c43aaac","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:59:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Medical Image Segmentation: Foundation Model Adaptation versus Task-Specific Training"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2a52ab19c2ffb090334e16fc7c9a3ec9237de3e67eb5ed7a96f2ed7aef17a70e","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-arxiv-toward-foundation-detection-models-via-example-bas-0-16dfbee56d/","observation_id":"obs_16dfbee56de33db2dfda3d59931f1172a7b5afaec5e3c1b6e65ccd055a53c798","published_at":"2026-11-10T18:59:17Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究提出一种面向病灶检测的多领域基础模型构建方法，通过师生训练和 EM-DETR 联合学习异构标注数据，以减轻灾难性遗忘并提升检测性能。","title":"Toward Foundation Detection Models via Example-Based Grounding in EM-DETR"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:计算机视觉","id":"tag:计算机视觉","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.333333,"topic":"AI Agent"}],"scenarios":[],"schema_version":"stack_trends_topic_v2","sources":[{"count":6,"name":"arxiv"}],"topic":"计算机视觉","windows":{"24h":null,"30d":{"confidence":"medium","counts":{"current":6,"pre_previous":17,"previous":15},"observations":6,"redundant_obs